      "buttonConfig": "Unified button config (flat fields): title, icon (SF Symbol name), color, backgroundColor, textColor, cornerRadius, borderColor, borderWidth, alpha, fontSize, shadow, displayMode ('icon'|'text'|'icon-text'), width, height, position, offsetX, offsetY, draggable. addChatListHeaderButton also supports placement ('leading'|'trailing'), before/after (proxy|compose|story|accountSwitcher) and order. Note: custom (animated) emoji renders in sent text but not inside native button titles."
    },
